WEBVTT

00:00:11.364 --> 00:00:12.365
(GRUNTS)

00:00:16.995 --> 00:00:18.496
It's okay.

00:00:28.298 --> 00:00:29.591
QUEENIE: Alohomora.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:33.637
Aberto.

00:00:34.804 --> 00:00:37.015
He would know
some fancy spell to lock his office.

00:00:40.352 --> 00:00:43.188
Okay, let's get the good stuff outta you.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:51.321
(SCREECHING)

00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:04.584
Witch!

00:01:14.719 --> 00:01:16.888
(YELPS) Mr. Scamander!

00:01:17.389 --> 00:01:18.682
Don't panic.

00:01:18.932 --> 00:01:20.475
What do you suggest I do instead?

00:01:20.684 --> 00:01:22.435
-(WHISTLES)
-(SCREECHES)

00:01:25.897 --> 00:01:26.981
Jump.

00:01:29.651 --> 00:01:30.819
Are you crazy?

00:01:31.611 --> 00:01:32.821
Jump on him.

00:01:35.573 --> 00:01:37.325
Tina, listen to me.

00:01:37.742 --> 00:01:39.035
I'll catch you.

00:01:40.245 --> 00:01:41.329
Tina.

00:01:47.502 --> 00:01:48.795
I'll catch you.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.423
I've got you, Tina.

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:53.925
-Go!
-(YELPS)

00:01:56.469 --> 00:01:57.470
(SCREECHES)

00:01:58.972 --> 00:02:00.098
Come on.

00:02:02.225 --> 00:02:03.226
(ALARMS RINGING)

00:02:12.861 --> 00:02:13.862
(SCREECHING)

00:02:15.405 --> 00:02:16.406
(SCREAMING)

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:22.287
Leave his brains. Come on. Come on!

00:02:25.206 --> 00:02:26.416
What is that thing?

00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:27.667
Swooping Evil.

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:29.461
Well, I love it. (CHUCKLES)

00:02:39.846 --> 00:02:40.847
(GASPS)

00:02:41.014 --> 00:02:42.015
(PANTING)

00:02:44.017 --> 00:02:45.018
Get in.

00:02:56.196 --> 00:02:57.197
MR. ABERNATHY: Queenie!

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:03.787
Where you going?

00:03:05.038 --> 00:03:06.289
I, uh...

00:03:06.456 --> 00:03:08.374
I'm sick, Mr. Abernathy.

00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:10.168
(COUGHS)

00:03:10.502 --> 00:03:11.628
Again?

00:03:11.961 --> 00:03:12.962
Oh. Uh...

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:14.839
Whatcha got there?

00:03:15.882 --> 00:03:17.342
Ladies' things.

00:03:18.259 --> 00:03:20.053
You wanna take a look? I don't mind.

00:03:20.553 --> 00:03:23.848
Good gravy. No. (CHUCKLES) I, uh...

00:03:25.141 --> 00:03:26.351
You get well now.

00:03:27.519 --> 00:03:28.603
Thanks.

00:03:42.659 --> 00:03:44.452
Credence, have you found the child?

00:03:46.788 --> 00:03:47.872
I can't.

00:03:48.957 --> 00:03:50.375
Show me.

00:03:55.213 --> 00:03:56.881
(SHUSHING)

00:03:58.883 --> 00:03:59.884
(WHIMPERING)

00:04:00.802 --> 00:04:02.762
My boy, the sooner we find this child,

00:04:02.929 --> 00:04:06.182
the sooner you can put that pain
in the past where it belongs.

00:04:08.434 --> 00:04:10.395
I want you to have this, Credence.

00:04:11.563 --> 00:04:14.649
I would trust very few with it.

00:04:16.985 --> 00:04:18.319
Very few.

00:04:21.531 --> 00:04:22.740
But you...

00:04:25.243 --> 00:04:26.578
You're different.

00:04:27.662 --> 00:04:29.873
And when you find the child,
you touch this symbol,

00:04:30.039 --> 00:04:32.083
and I will know and I will come to you.

00:04:34.752 --> 00:04:37.881
Do this, and you will be honored

00:04:38.923 --> 00:04:41.718
among wizards forever.

00:04:44.637 --> 00:04:46.556
The child is dying, Credence.

00:04:50.393 --> 00:04:52.145
Time is running out.

00:05:04.866 --> 00:05:07.118
Your grandfather kept pigeons?

00:05:07.285 --> 00:05:08.620
Mine bred owls.

00:05:10.288 --> 00:05:11.956
I used to love feeding them.

00:05:12.206 --> 00:05:16.002
TINA: Graves always insisted
the disturbances were caused by a beast.

00:05:16.336 --> 00:05:17.545
We need to catch all your creatures

00:05:17.712 --> 00:05:19.797
so he can't
keep using them as a scapegoat.

00:05:19.964 --> 00:05:21.841
There's only one still missing.

00:05:22.008 --> 00:05:23.468
Dougal, my Demiguise.

00:05:24.135 --> 00:05:25.345
Dougal?

00:05:26.179 --> 00:05:29.432
Slight problem is that,
um, he's invisible.

00:05:32.226 --> 00:05:33.728
-Invisible?
-Yes.

00:05:34.270 --> 00:05:36.272
Most of the time. He does, um...

00:05:39.651 --> 00:05:41.945
-How do you catch something--
-With immense difficulty.

00:05:45.198 --> 00:05:46.199
Oh.

00:05:46.658 --> 00:05:47.659
(CHUCKLES)

00:05:52.372 --> 00:05:53.373
Gnarlak.

00:05:53.831 --> 00:05:55.458
-Excuse me?
-Gnarlak.

00:05:55.917 --> 00:05:58.628
He was an informant of mine
when I was an Auror.

00:05:59.337 --> 00:06:02.215
He used to trade
in magical creatures on the side.

00:06:03.132 --> 00:06:05.802
He wouldn't happen to have an interest
in paw prints, would he?

00:06:08.012 --> 00:06:10.556
He's interested in anything he can sell.

00:06:15.853 --> 00:06:17.313
(1920s MUSIC PLAYING)

